%% Synthetic sensor calibration; example facts and caption are in diagram-frameworks.md.
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Calibration revised using retained trial history
    accDescr: Initialize the setting and an empty trial log once. Measure a fixed reference, retain the setting and residual, then stop at tolerance or budget. Otherwise revise the setting using the log and return to measurement without resetting history.
    initialize("Initialize setting\nand empty log") --> measure("Measure with\ncurrent setting")
    reference["Fixed reference"] -. input .-> measure
    measure -->|setting and residual| retain("Append to trial log\nKeep previous trials")
    retain --> stop{"Tolerance met\nor budget exhausted?"}
    stop -->|yes| result[["Setting and trial log\nRecord stop reason"]]
    stop -->|no| revise("Revise setting\nusing retained log")
    revise -->|updated setting| measure
    class initialize,measure,retain,revise operation
    class result result
    classDef operation stroke:#3B82F6,stroke-width:2px
    classDef result stroke:#0D9488,stroke-width:2px
